From f05c6a3ab150802881e7e32d8394843f79bc0332 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GGbot <ggbot@local>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 06:15:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] journey v3.1: journey-only deep night sea tint

IslandProps.sync takes journey (region-travel) and fades a journey weight; seaColorAt(authored,w,j)
lerps the night tint #7f9fb3 -> #2c4058 by j. Day (w=0) is always the authored colour. Tests in t9 island props.
